[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 543.19, "timestamp": "00:09:03", "text": "这真的太了不起了。 这话说得太过了，简直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 546.31, "timestamp": "00:09:06", "text": "令人难以置信。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 548.47, "timestamp": "00:09:08", "text": "但我们现在就处在这种境地。 目前有多少条直播流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 550.31, "timestamp": "00:09:10", "text": "？ 你觉得会有多少？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 550.79, "timestamp": "00:09:10", "text": "138."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 552.23, "timestamp": "00:09:12", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 554.87, "timestamp": "00:09:14", "text": "真是见鬼了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 555.75, "timestamp": "00:09:15", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 558.389, "timestamp": "00:09:18", "text": "我个人会关掉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 560.55, "timestamp": "00:09:20", "text": "直播然后睡觉。   如果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 568.55, "timestamp": "00:09:28", "text": "不过，说说你自己的情况吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 570.389, "timestamp": "00:09:30", "text": "最近过得怎么样？ 虽然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 579.43, "timestamp": "00:09:39", "text": "这些天我一直在默默地关注着你。 让我看看。 嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 584.07, "timestamp": "00:09:44", "text": "最近几天还算可以吧。 嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 586.79, "timestamp": "00:09:46", "text": "有些事情让我很兴奋，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 590.15, "timestamp": "00:09:50", "text": "比如我从 OBS 换成了 Melina。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 593.829, "timestamp": "00:09:53", "text": "这是我从没想过会做的事情，我竟然会"}]